*>   6.2 registrations that need no renderer
     MOVE "player" TO WS-PNAME
     CALL "EM6-RENDERER-EXEMPT" USING WS-PNAME WS-R
     MOVE "player has no registered renderer provider" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 1 TO WS-E
     MOVE WS-R TO WS-O
